1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,230
Listen to an announcement at a University Club meeting.

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:08,090
Man: I see we have a lot of new members here this evening.

3
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:11,493
Tonight we'll focus on getting to know each other,

4
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:16,030
and starting next week we'll be talking about some exciting new projects,

5
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,299
including volunteering at local elementary schools,

6
00:00:18,299 --> 00:00:22,080
fundraising for local charities, and planting trees in City Park.

7
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:27,210
I hope you're as excited about giving back to the broader community around our university as I am.

8
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:32,080
I'll start by telling you a bit about myself and then we'll go around the room.
